abstract: >-
  A proprietary, publicly inspectable research framework for reproducible
  simulation and evaluation of support-aware neuro-olfactive artificial
  intelligence, contextual olfactory memory, open-set recognition,
  reliability-gated multimodal retrieval, selective prediction, and
  transparent negative-result reporting.
